WEBVTT

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:26.260
(Return to innocence Listen to the earth)

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:08.200
Agua del río
(Water of the river)

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:11.600
Lava mi alma
(Wash my soul)

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:15.000
Viento del norte
(North wind)

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:18.300
trae la calma
(Bring the calm)

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.840
Pisando tierra
(stepping on earth)

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:25.200
con pies descalzos
(with bare feet)

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:28.720
dejando atrás
(leaving behind)

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:35.800
a los falsos Espíritu libre
(The fake ones In the wind)

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:36.740
donde la

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:44.000
vida comienza
(Life begins)

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:49.140
Escucha el canto
(listen to the song)

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.420
Baila suave
(Of the trees dance softly)

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.920
Somos polvo
(In the breeze we are dust)

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:59.140
de las estrellas
(of the stars)

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:02.300
Buscando cosas
(Looking for things)

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:09.600
más bellas
(More beautiful)

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:51.040
Fuego que quema
(fire that burns)

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:54.440
Fuego que sana
(fire that heals)

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.700
Abro mi mente
(I open my mind)

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:01.180
por la mañana
(in the morning)

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:04.440
Árbol antiguo
(ancient tree)

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:08.000
dame tu fuerza
(give me your strength)

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:11.280
que mi camino
(may my path)

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:13.800
no se tuerza
(Not twist)

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.000
Espíritu libre
(In the wind)

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.180
donde la

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:23.200
vida comienza
(Life begins)

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:30.420
Escucha el canto
(listen to the song)

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:37.400
Baila suave
